# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: AI-Overseas (Custom)
# Description: Custom overrides and verified new domains for overseas AI services
# Anti-Collision & Precision Scoping:
#   - Gemini: Uses exact DOMAIN rules. Prohibits broad googleapis.com or google.com
#   - Grok: Uses grok.com and x.ai. Strictly separated from twitter.com / x.com
#   - Muse from Meta (App Store ID: 6760173601): Meta 于 2026-09-08 官方发布的个人 AI 代理 (Personal AI Agent)，
#     在 iOS、Android 与 muse.ai 发布。使用 muse.ai。严格与 Meta 社交全家桶 (facebook, instagram, meta.com) 隔离。
# ==============================================================================

# --- Google Gemini Endpoints (Public developer endpoints & web frontend) ---
# Target: Gemini WebChannel/gRPC streaming endpoint
# Evidence: Public WebChannel / gRPC protocol documentation and SDK reference
# Reason: Routes Gemini streaming chat to AI policy without falling back to general Google
DOMAIN,webchannel-robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com

# Target: Gemini REST/RPC frontend API
# Evidence: Public Google Cloud API endpoint reference
# Reason: Direct routing of Gemini API calls
DOMAIN,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com

# Target: Gemini Web frontend backend service API
# Evidence: Public Gemini web application frontend architecture
# Reason: Direct routing of Gemini web chat API
DOMAIN,geminiweb-pa.googleapis.com

# Target: Gemini static web CDN assets
# Evidence: Public static asset host for Gemini UI components
# Reason: Fast loading of Gemini UI components
DOMAIN,gemini.gstatic.com

# Target: Cloud Code / Gemini Code Assist backend API
# Evidence: Public Cloud Code developer documentation
# Reason: Routes IDE AI code completion requests to AI policy
DOMAIN,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com

# Target: Google AI Studio web portal
# Evidence: Official Google AI Studio developer portal (https://aistudio.google.com/)
# Reason: Dedicated AI Studio developer portal routing
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com

# Target: Google Generative Language API (Gemini developer REST/gRPC API)
# Evidence: Official Google AI Developer Documentation (https://ai.google.dev/)
# Reason: Explicit routing for Gemini official API calls to AI overseas egress
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# --- xAI / Grok (Strictly segregated from Twitter / X main platform) ---
# Target: xAI Grok standalone app & web platform
# Evidence: Official xAI platform and developer API endpoints (https://x.ai/)
# Reason: Independent AI routing; must not trigger Twitter proxy policies
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
DOMAIN,api.x.ai

# --- Muse from Meta (App Store ID: 6760173601) ---
# Target: https://muse.ai/ (Official web platform for Muse from Meta personal AI agent)
# Evidence: Meta official release announcement (2026-09-08) & App Store official listing (ID: 6760173601)
# Reason: Personal AI agent routing; strictly segregated from Meta social suites (facebook.com, instagram.com, meta.com)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai

# --- Other Confirmed Overseas AI Services ---
# Target: Perplexity AI search
# Evidence: Official web & app telemetry, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Dedicated AI search engine routing
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai

# Target: Poe AI multi-bot aggregator
# Evidence: Quora / Poe service telemetry, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Multi-model AI aggregation routing
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poe.com

# Target: OpenAI Sora video platform
# Evidence: OpenAI Sora service announcement & domain registration, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Dedicated video generation service routing
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com

# Target: Cohere AI platform
# Evidence: Official developer documentation & API trace, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Enterprise AI API routing
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cohere.com
